## Conventions

- Components in `src/components/`
- Pages in `src/app/` (Next.js App Router) or `src/pages/`
- Shared types in `src/types/`
- API calls in `src/lib/api.ts`
- No business logic in UI components — delegate to hooks/services

## State Management

- Server state: React Query or SWR
- Local UI state: useState / useReducer
- Global app state: Zustand (if needed)
